claim.claim-text:
a semiconductor structure including a first conductive semiconductor layer (124), a second conductive semiconductor layer (127), and an active layer (126);
a first electrode (151) provided on a first surface of the first conductive semiconductor layer (124);
a second electrode (161) provided on a first surface of the second conductive semiconductor layer (127), the active layer (126) being provided between the first surface of the first conductive semiconductor layer (124) and a second surface of the second conductive semiconductor layer (127) that is opposite to the first surface of the second conductive semiconductor layer (127);
a first cover electrode (152) provided on the first electrode (151) and the first surface of the first conductive semiconductor layer (124); and
a second cover electrode (164) provided on the second electrode (161);
wherein the second cover electrode (164) includes a plurality of second branch electrodes (164-1) extending in a first plan direction and a second connection electrode (164-2) extending in a second plan direction to connect the plurality of branch electrodes (164-1), and
wherein the first cover electrode (152) includes a plurality of first branch electrodes (152-1) extending in the first plan direction and provided between the second branch electrodes and a first connection electrode (152-2) in the second plan direction to connect the plurality of first branch electrodes (152-1).
